# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unity generated folders — never commit these. This is what let the
# old repos balloon (a 331 MB Library/ was committed once).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset meta data should only exist when the asset itself is tracked.
!/**/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# Unity-generated IDE/project files. Anchored to the repo ROOT with a leading
# slash so Unity's auto-generated LeastCountGameNew.sln / Assembly-CSharp.csproj
# (which land at the root) are ignored WITHOUT touching the hand-authored .NET
# project under core/.
/*.csproj
/*.unityproj
/*.sln
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.opendb
*.VC.db
.vs/
.idea/
# (core/LeastCount.sln and core/**/*.csproj are NOT matched by the root-anchored
#  rules above, so they stay tracked. core/bin and core/obj are ignored by core/.gitignore.)

# Gradle / Android build intermediates
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — must never be committed (see CLAUDE.md hard constraints).
# A signing keystore and live Photon App IDs already leaked in the old repos.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pepk
keystore.properties
secrets*.json
**/*.secret

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Crash reports
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# NOTE: the pure C# rules engine under core/ has its own core/.gitignore
# for bin/ and obj/. The *.sln / *.csproj rules above intentionally do NOT
# break it, because core/ is a normal .NET project you build directly.
